<title>USA: U.S. business loans fell $900 mln in Jan 8 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans fell $900 mln in Jan 8 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks fell $900 million to $787.5 billion in the week ended Jan 8, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
